<title>UK: Vaux expects more modest second half profit.</title>
<headline>Vaux expects more modest second half profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>British brewer and hotels company Vaux Group Plc said on Thursday that group profits are expected to progress in the second half of the current financial year at a &quot;more modest pace&quot; than in the first half.</p>
</text>
